      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thank you for getting ready!VRChat is always doing a good job!\nThe same problem occurs in the adventure world I created, Pandora ep.4-Twilight, but the symptoms are a little different.\nUnity 2018 allows you to join.\nVRChat will exit immediately after returning to HOME.\nThis is the log at that time.\n2021.07.27 02:28:24 Error      -  [API] [388, 502, Put, 2] Request Finished with Error!\nhttps://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/joins?apiKey=JlE5Jldo5Jibnk5O5hTx6XVqsJu4WJ26&organization=vrchat\n{{\"userId\":\"〇〇〇〇〇\", \"worldId\":\"wrld_〇〇〇〇〇:00352~private(〇〇〇〇〇)~region(jp)~nonce(3A15466514E33110D498405868422C0E4D6D3FC56DD15EBA)\"}}\nNo Exception\n<html>\n<head><title>502 Bad Gateway</title></head>\n<body>\n<center><h1>502 Bad Gateway</h1></center>\n</body>\n</html>\n2021.07.27 02:28:24 Error      -  [Behaviour] Error posting join:\nBad Gateway\n〇〇〇〇〇:00352~private(〇〇〇〇〇)~region(jp)~nonce(3A15466514E33110D498405868422C0E4D6D3FC56DD15EBA)\n2021.07.27 02:28:25 Log        -  [Behaviour] Unloading scenes\n502 Bad Gateway error.Is there any reference?\nSave the mysterious and precious open world born in VRChat.Thank you always!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
