  "details": "When OpenBeta enters a world of large size, it is found that something timed out and cannot enter.\nWe tested both Unity 2018 and OpenBeta and checked the logs of the relevant parts.\nPlease check the attached image.\nThere is no problem with any of the current Unity 2018.\nOpenBeta is experiencing this problem.\n◆ What I tried\n·I tried VR mode and desktop mode, but it didn't work.\n·I checked with two PCs, but both failed.\n·I checked with a different account, but it didn't work.\n·Check with other players (Ryzen's amazing high spec!)I put you in the world!\n·I checked in two worlds.Approximately 800M/900M, both behaved the same way and returned to HOME.\n◆ Consideration\nCan high-spec PCs that can deploy the world before the set timeout enter the world correctly?",
